sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Car
    participant LPR
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant SAP
    participant Kiosk
    participant Phone
    participant Queue
    participant Gate

    Note over Car,Gate: Path A — Generic QR always available
    Kiosk->>Phone: Generic URL /checkin?gate=gateId
    Phone->>MW: POST /checkin/submit plate name phone
    MW->>Queue: enqueueFromCheckin
    alt New plate
        MW->>Gate: open if rate-limit NX 30s OK
    else Duplicate plate
        MW-->>Phone: 409 already_queued
    end

    Note over Car,Gate: Path B — LPR + SAP miss
    Car->>LPR: Approach gate
    LPR->>MW: plate-read
    MW->>SAP: lookupByPlate
    SAP-->>MW: null
    MW->>Kiosk: Token QR plate prefilled editable
    Phone->>MW: GET ticket then submit name phone
    MW->>Queue: enqueue
    MW->>Gate: open if rate limit OK

    Note over Car,Gate: Path C — LPR + SAP hit
    Car->>LPR: Approach gate
    LPR->>MW: plate-read
    MW->>SAP: lookupByPlate
    SAP-->>MW: name phone plate
    MW->>Kiosk: Welcome name + Token QR
    Phone->>MW: Prefill locked plate then Submit
    MW->>Queue: enqueue
    MW->>Gate: open if rate limit OK
